## 4. Target Calculation

For standard cricket matches:

<text>Target = First Innings Total + 1</text>

The first innings total must include all extras.

Example:

- First innings: 145.
- Target: 146.

Do not use wickets or overs in target calculation for standard completed innings.

Persist the target in the match state and derive it from the finalized first innings when appropriate. Avoid conflicting target calculations in frontend and backend.

